#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:6
#: ec672c94913a4c3489289746dbfa0539
msgid "Setting up the waf Build Environment on Windows using Cygwin"
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 Cygwin 搭建 waf 构建环境"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:8
#: e8c30983a4ad4f4c81b70c2e4baf6089
msgid ""
"These setup instructions describe how to setup `Cygwin "
"<http://www.cygwin.com/>`__ on so that waf (the build system) can run "
"natively on windows and build for all supported boards."
msgstr ""
"这些配置说明介绍如何在 Windows 上配置 `Cygwin <http://www.cygwin.com/>`__，使 waf（构建系统）可在 "
"Windows 上原生运行并为所有支持的板子构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:12
#: 90695ed24e3748a0ae517e49fe5913b7
msgid ""
"There is a pre-built script at "
"`/ardupilot/Tools/environment_install/install-prereqs-windows.ps1 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/environment_install/install-"
"prereqs-windows.ps1>`__ that will automatically perform all of the below "
"steps."
msgstr ""
"在 `/ardupilot/Tools/environment_install/install-prereqs-windows.ps1 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/environment_install/install-"
"prereqs-windows.ps1>`__ 处提供了一个预构建脚本，可自动执行以下所有步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:17
#: 0d9a0b620a874ec583a7d34059713a65
msgid "Install Cygwin"
msgstr "安装 Cygwin"

