"submodule updates to fail, in this instance you can tell git to unilaterally"
" use https through the following command:"
msgstr "如果某些防火墙不允许 SSH 访问（这可能导致上述子模块更新失败），在这种情况下，您可以通过以下命令告知 git 统一使用 https："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:148
#: 8fe3202815c94055b2e7d911b083b71a
msgid "to use https protocols instead of the default git:// prefix."
msgstr "以使用 https 协议代替默认的 git:// 前缀。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:152
#: f707a09a49374a339a70520202788e0f
msgid "Build with Waf"
msgstr "使用 Waf 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:154
#: 8de12f63a14c4e41b1cd4a771a1aa999
msgid ""
"You should now be able to start the \"Cygwin Terminal\" application from "
"your Windows Start menu and build with waf as described in `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"现在您应该能够从 Windows 开始菜单启动「Cygwin Terminal」应用程序，并按照 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 中的说明使用 waf "
"进行构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:158
#: acd2874d115c4ce18e0f51a67f04a41f
msgid ""
"The build may fail if the file path to some files is too long.  If the build"
" fails, please try :ref:`cloning <git-clone>` ArduPilot into a directory "
"very high in the directory structure (i.e. ~/ardupilot)."
msgstr ""
"如果某些文件的路径过长，构建可能会失败。若构建失败，请尝试将 ArduPilot :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` "
"到目录结构较高层的目录中（例如 ~/ardupilot）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:160
#: c4210e0dc0ed4fe3b3a94162b3edf102
msgid ""
"If during the build process you get an error of missing packet xyz, re-check"
" that you have installed all Cygwin packages listed above"
msgstr "如果在构建过程中收到缺少 xyz 包的错误，请重新检查是否已安装上述所有 Cygwin 软件包"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:163
#: 4735e0a2ae324fd1a16a0e91246ba5f6
msgid "Running SITL"
msgstr "运行 SITL (软件在环仿真)"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:165
#: 89eeecc8426b4b9788fc36141a0c1a7e
msgid ""
"You can run SITL just as you can with any other build environment. To see "
"the terminal, you should install VcXsrv or another X server application for "
"Windows. You must then tell Cygwin where to look for the display by setting "
"the DISPLAY variable."
msgstr ""
"您可以像在任何其他构建环境中一样运行 SITL (软件在环仿真)。要查看终端，应在 Windows 上安装 VcXsrv 或其他 X "
"服务器应用程序，然后通过设置 DISPLAY 变量告知 Cygwin 在哪里查找显示器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:172
#: cb0b197c7d6a4244816bd9923a77cba4
msgid "Build SITL binaries for Windows"
msgstr "为 Windows 构建 SITL 二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-cygwin.rst:174
#: d3779309d580437a9849b8ebbda8e888
msgid ""
"You can build 32-bit binaries to be run outside of Cygwin with a small set "
"of companion files. This can be useful when used in conjunction with Mission"
" Planner to run SITL with a stable release build rather than a build from "
"the development branch of ArduPilot. This can be done by compiling using the"
" command below in Cygwin and copying the binary the \"sitl\" folder "
"typically found at C:\\\\Users\\\\user\\\\Documents\\\\Mission "
"Planner\\\\sitl. Mission Planner will download the required files during the"
" first time running SITL. After the initial run, the vehicle-specific binary"
" file can be replaced with the file you built. The custom SITL binaries "
"should be located at /ardupilot/build/sitl."
msgstr ""
"您可以构建 32 位二进制文件，以便在 Cygwin 外部配合一小组附带文件运行。当与 Mission Planner 结合使用，以稳定发行版构建（而非"
" ArduPilot 开发分支构建）运行 SITL (软件在环仿真) 时，这会很有用。可在 Cygwin "
"中使用下方命令进行编译，并将二进制文件复制到「sitl」文件夹（通常位于 "
"C:\\\\Users\\\\user\\\\Documents\\\\Mission Planner\\\\sitl）。Mission Planner"
" 将在首次运行 SITL (软件在环仿真) 时下载所需文件。完成初始运行后，可将车辆专用的二进制文件替换为您构建的文件。自定义 SITL "
"二进制文件应位于 /ardupilot/build/sitl。"
